An agent in CI with no waiver, and one given a flag that narrows a prompt
rather than removing it. Running an agent unattended is not the finding; the
prompt being waived is.

>>> .github/workflows/review.yml
name: review
on: [pull_request]
jobs:
  agent:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - run: claude -p "review this"
      - run: claude -p "review this" --permission-mode acceptEdits
      - run: gemini --approval-mode auto_edit -p "fix it"
